<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Used -->
  <CBF_K_Used>已使用</CBF_K_Used>
  <!-- EN: Create a new category. It goes into your mod's category file. -->
  <CBF_K_NewTip>建立新類別，存進你模組的類別檔案。</CBF_K_NewTip>
  <!-- EN: Pick a category on the left. -->
  <CBF_K_PickOne>請在左側選擇一個類別。</CBF_K_PickOne>
  <!-- EN: Opens the category's file in your text editor. The editor reloads changes made there on its own. -->
  <CBF_K_OpenFileTip>在你的文字編輯器中開啟此類別的檔案。在那裡所做的變更，編輯器會自動重新載入。</CBF_K_OpenFileTip>
  <!-- EN: 1 piece -->
  <CBF_K_OnePiece>1個部件</CBF_K_OnePiece>
  <!-- EN: Click opens the piece in the Piece tab. Back returns here. -->
  <CBF_K_TileTip>點擊會在「部件」分頁開啟此部件，按「返回」回到這裡。</CBF_K_TileTip>
  <!-- EN: Used in: -->
  <CBF_K_UsedIn>用於：</CBF_K_UsedIn>
  <!-- EN: No settlement uses this category directly. -->
  <CBF_K_NotUsed>沒有據點直接使用此類別。</CBF_K_NotUsed>
  <!-- EN: {0}, district {1}, {2} to {3} -->
  <CBF_K_UsedInDistrict>{0}，街區{1}，{2}至{3}</CBF_K_UsedInDistrict>
  <!-- EN: {0}, fortification -->
  <CBF_K_UsedInWalls>{0}，防禦工事</CBF_K_UsedInWalls>
  <!-- EN: Category -->
  <CBF_Category>類別</CBF_Category>
  <!-- EN: Parent -->
  <CBF_K_Parent>上層類別</CBF_K_Parent>
  <!-- EN: The category this one inherits from. Whatever is not set here comes from there. -->
  <CBF_K_ParentTip>此類別繼承的來源類別。這裡沒設定的部分都取自那裡。</CBF_K_ParentTip>
  <!-- EN: Placement -->
  <CBF_K_Placement>擺放</CBF_K_Placement>
  <!-- EN: Road access -->
  <CBF_K_RoadAccess>道路連通</CBF_K_RoadAccess>
  <!-- EN: Must be reachable from the road network. -->
  <CBF_K_RoadAccessTip>必須能從道路網抵達。</CBF_K_RoadAccessTip>
  <!-- EN: Unique -->
  <CBF_Unique>唯一</CBF_Unique>
  <!-- EN: At most one per settlement. -->
  <CBF_K_UniqueTip>每個據點最多一個。</CBF_K_UniqueTip>
  <!-- EN: Wall contact -->
  <CBF_K_WallContact>貼牆</CBF_K_WallContact>
  <!-- EN: Yes: pieces of this category prefer to stand at the town wall. The piece field "At the wall" controls it more finely and wins. -->
  <CBF_K_WallContactTip>是：此類別的部件偏好緊靠城牆。部件欄位「靠牆」能更細地控制，且優先於此設定。</CBF_K_WallContactTip>
  <!-- EN: Near the gate -->
  <CBF_K_PrefGate>靠近城門</CBF_K_PrefGate>
  <!-- EN: How strongly this wants to be near the gate. -->
  <CBF_K_PrefGateTip>有多想靠近城門。</CBF_K_PrefGateTip>
  <!-- EN: Near the center -->
  <CBF_K_PrefCenter>靠近中心</CBF_K_PrefCenter>
  <!-- EN: How strongly this wants to be near the center. -->
  <CBF_K_PrefCenterTip>有多想靠近中心。</CBF_K_PrefCenterTip>
  <!-- EN: Near the wall -->
  <CBF_K_PrefWall>靠近城牆</CBF_K_PrefWall>
  <!-- EN: How strongly this wants to be near the wall. -->
  <CBF_K_PrefWallTip>有多想靠近城牆。</CBF_K_PrefWallTip>
  <!-- EN: Main road -->
  <CBF_K_PrefMain>主要道路</CBF_K_PrefMain>
  <!-- EN: How strongly this wants to be on the main road. -->
  <CBF_K_PrefMainTip>有多想位於主要道路旁。</CBF_K_PrefMainTip>
  <!-- EN: Blocks -->
  <CBF_K_Blocks>街廓</CBF_K_Blocks>
  <!-- EN: Block limit -->
  <CBF_K_BlockMax>街廓上限</CBF_K_BlockMax>
  <!-- EN: How many buildings of this category at most form one block wall to wall. Empty means the planner uses its default of 3. -->
  <CBF_K_BlockMaxTip>此類別的建築最多幾棟會牆貼牆組成一個街廓。留空表示規劃器使用預設值3。</CBF_K_BlockMaxTip>
  <!-- EN: Merge -->
  <CBF_K_Merge>合併</CBF_K_Merge>
  <!-- EN: Whether buildings of this category join their neighbors into one block. Yes forces it, No forbids it. -->
  <CBF_K_MergeTip>此類別的建築是否與鄰居合併成一個街廓。「是」強制合併，「否」禁止合併。</CBF_K_MergeTip>
  <!-- EN: inherits -->
  <CBF_K_Inherits>繼承</CBF_K_Inherits>
  <!-- EN: Without a value of its own, {0} applies, from {1}. -->
  <CBF_K_InheritsFrom>沒有自己的值時套用{0}，來自{1}。</CBF_K_InheritsFrom>
  <!-- EN: inherits {0} -->
  <CBF_K_InheritsValue>繼承{0}</CBF_K_InheritsValue>
  <!-- EN: the default -->
  <CBF_K_Default>預設值</CBF_K_Default>
  <!-- EN: Chain: no parent category -->
  <CBF_K_NoParentChain>繼承鏈：沒有上層類別</CBF_K_NoParentChain>
  <!-- EN: Chain: {0} -->
  <CBF_K_Chain>繼承鏈：{0}</CBF_K_Chain>
  <!-- EN: {0} belongs to the mod {1}. The editor does not save changes to it. -->
  <CBF_K_Foreign>{0}屬於模組{1}，編輯器不會儲存對它的變更。</CBF_K_Foreign>
  <!-- EN: Opens the settlement. -->
  <CBF_K_UsedInJump>開啟此據點。</CBF_K_UsedInJump>
  <!-- EN: Weight -->
  <CBF_K_Weight>權重</CBF_K_Weight>
  <!-- EN: How often pieces of this category are drawn when several fit. 1 is normal. For annexes, a value below 1 also acts as the chance that the annex is tried at all. -->
  <CBF_K_WeightTip>有多個部件符合時，抽中此類別部件的頻率。1為一般。對附屬建築而言，低於1的值同時也是嘗試建造該附屬建築的機率。</CBF_K_WeightTip>
  <!-- EN: Annexes -->
  <CBF_K_Annexes>附屬建築</CBF_K_Annexes>
  <!-- EN: Annex categories -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexCategories>附屬建築類別</CBF_K_AnnexCategories>
  <!-- EN: Which annexes may attach to pieces of this category. Empty takes the list of the parent category. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexCategoriesTip>哪些附屬建築可以接在此類別的部件上。留空則沿用上層類別的清單。</CBF_K_AnnexCategoriesTip>
  <!-- EN: Click removes the category. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexRemoveTip>點擊移除此類別。</CBF_K_AnnexRemoveTip>
  <!-- EN: none -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexNone>無</CBF_K_AnnexNone>
  <!-- EN: Add annex category -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexAdd>新增附屬建築類別</CBF_K_AnnexAdd>
  <!-- EN: Chance per anchor -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexChance>每個錨點的機率</CBF_K_AnnexChance>
  <!-- EN: Chance that an annex is built at an annex anchor of the house. Default 0.6. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexChanceTip>在房屋的附屬建築錨點建造附屬建築的機率。預設0.6。</CBF_K_AnnexChanceTip>
  <!-- EN: At most -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexMax>最多</CBF_K_AnnexMax>
  <!-- EN: At most this many annexes per house. Default 2. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexMaxTip>每棟房屋最多幾個附屬建築。預設2。</CBF_K_AnnexMaxTip>
  <!-- EN: Repeatable -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexMultiple>可重複</CBF_K_AnnexMultiple>
  <!-- EN: Applies to the category of the annex. Yes allows the same annex several times on the same house. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexMultipleTip>套用於附屬建築本身的類別。「是」允許同一個附屬建築在同一棟房屋上出現多次。</CBF_K_AnnexMultipleTip>
  <!-- EN: Full wall -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexFull>整面牆</CBF_K_AnnexFull>
  <!-- EN: Applies to the category of the annex. Yes: the annex only attaches where it covers the whole wall side of the house, end to end. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexFullTip>套用於附屬建築本身的類別。是：附屬建築只會接在能從頭到尾覆蓋房屋整面牆的位置。</CBF_K_AnnexFullTip>
  <!-- EN: Overhang -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexOverhang>突出</CBF_K_AnnexOverhang>
  <!-- EN: With Full wall: how many cells the annex must reach past the house wall at each end. 0 means flush. -->
  <CBF_K_AnnexOverhangTip>搭配「整面牆」：附屬建築兩端必須超出房屋牆面幾格。0表示齊平。</CBF_K_AnnexOverhangTip>
  <!-- EN: Needs no road -->
  <CBF_K_NoRoad>不需道路</CBF_K_NoRoad>
  <!-- EN: Buildings of this category need no road and may be entered from every side, like a farm or a market. Only takes effect when Road access is No. Where they stand is decided by the budget of the ward. -->
  <CBF_K_NoRoadTip>此類別的建築不需要道路，可從任何一側進入，例如農場或市集。只有在「道路連通」為「否」時才生效。它們的位置由城區的預算決定。</CBF_K_NoRoadTip>
  <!-- EN: Pieces -->
  <CBF_K_Pieces>部件</CBF_K_Pieces>
  <!-- EN: Add piece -->
  <CBF_K_AddPiece>加入部件</CBF_K_AddPiece>
  <!-- EN: Pick a piece and add this category to it. The piece keeps its other categories. Save at the bottom writes the piece, for pieces of other mods as a patch in your mod. -->
  <CBF_K_AddPieceTip>選擇一個部件並把此類別加給它。部件保留其他類別。底部的「儲存」會寫入部件；其他模組的部件會以補丁寫入你的模組。</CBF_K_AddPieceTip>
  <!-- EN: Also saves the pieces added to this category: {0} -->
  <CBF_K_SavePiecesTip>也會儲存加入此類別的部件：{0}</CBF_K_SavePiecesTip>
</LanguageData>
